 in the flesh. This is the deceiver and the Antichrist."},{"verse":8,"text":"Watch yourselves, that we don’t lose the things which we have accomplished, but that we receive a full reward."},{"verse":9,"text":"Whoever transgresses and doesn’t remain in the teaching of Christ doesn’t have God. He who remains in the teaching has both the Father and the Son."},{"verse":10,"text":"If anyone comes to you and doesn’t bring this teaching, don’t receive him into your house, and don’t welcome him,"},{"verse":11,"text":"for he who welcomes him participates in his evil deeds."},{"verse":12,"text":"Having many things to write to you, I don’t want to do so with paper and ink, but I hope to come to you and to speak face to face, that our joy may be made full."},{"verse":13,"text":"The children of your chosen sister greet you. Amen."}],"hasArtwork":true,"artworkUrl":"/data/images/books/2john.svg","availableLangs":["zh-CN"]}]